{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfv1Xjhgcyu7s1yXTi47N","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I wrote the suite in `tests/test_agent.py`. It has 164 tests (including parametrized cases), and all of them pass with your venv command. There is one `DeprecationWarning` from `strptime` in the no-year date test.\n\nI didn't change any library code, and I wrote the tests from reading `parse/__init__.py`. They cover:\n- **Core parsing:** fixed and named fields, `parse`/`search`/`findall`/`compile`, `pos`/`endpos`, `evaluate_result=False`, and result spans.\n- **Names:** dotted, dashed and `a[b]` field names, repeated names and `RepeatedNameError`, and case sensitivity.\n- **Escaping:** regex special characters in literal text and `{{ }}`.\n- **Number types:** `d`, `b`, `o`, `x`, `n`, `f`, `F`, `e`, `g`, `%`, including sign, grouping, fill/alignment, width and precision.\n- **Date and time types:** `ti`, `tg`, `ta`, `te`, `th`, `tc`, `tt`, `ts`, strptime-style formats (`%Y-%m-%d` and similar), and timezone handling.\n- **Other:** `extract_format`, `with_pattern`, `extra_types` with `regex_group_count`, and checks that later fields still map to the right group after complex types.\n\nSix tests failed on my first run. In each case my expectation was wrong, not the library. I corrected those expectations rather than editing `parse`. Examples are a miscounted span offset and comparing tz-aware datetimes to naive ones. I also removed a few assertions that could never fail.\n\nTwo behaviours I noticed and did not assert:\n- `{:d}` accepts `\"--1\"` and returns -1.\n- With an explicit width, a string field such as `{:>5}` captures the padding along with the value.\n\nIf you consider either one a bug, say so and I can add tests that expect the stricter behaviour."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":767,"cache_read_input_tokens":54291,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":767},"output_tokens":648,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aabbe61e-2c25-4a20-964b-4f01147a6da3","uuid":"a7443740-29ab-4acf-8a0b-a652b8888732","timestamp":"2026-10-11T06:53:57.122Z","request_id":"req_011Cfv1XjLbxUuN58Py1gCcX"}
